'''Frankie''' is an [[NPC]] who first appears in the {{Zone|Barry Center}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. They start out as a protestor against {{NPCSprite|Barry}}, but after the player handles their complaints, they move to {{zone|Barry HQ}} and become a worker.

