== Trivia ==
*Their dialogue refers to game distribution services [[w:Steam_(service)|Steam]] as {{blue|Vapor}} and [[w:Epic_Games_Store|Epic Games Store]] as {{Red|Grandiose Games}}.
*While in {{Zone|Barry Center}}, '''Frankie''' and the other protestors have dialogue above their heads, such as "{{Rmt|Barry bad!}}", "{{Rmt|Go away Barry!}}", "{{Rmt|Barry is trash.}}", "{{Rmt|Go away Barry!}}", "{{Rmt|Barry boooo!}}", and "{{Rmt|Barry sucks!}}"

